        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for suggestion!\r\n\r\nI remember thinking about implementing it in 'mini.completion' for some time, but something stopped me. Might be either my decision that it doesn't have necessary cost/benefit ratio (hitting single `(` after function completion doesn't seem *that* hard), some implementation difficulty, or something else. I am more inclined to think that it the the first one, but I'll take another look.",
