            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Thanks! All `mini.completion` needs to do is emit the event with the LSP data. I imagine there's more work in the `mini.pairs` end of the task?\r\n\r\nOn the contrary. What I was thinking about is that 'mini.completion' will result into adding `()` if entry has type \"Function\" or \"Method\".\r\n\r\nThe 'mini.pairs' module is almost certainly stays as is.",
