        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After thinking about it again, I don't think having automatically placed `()` after accepting completion entry for function has good usefullness/complexity ratio. That is, with 'mini.pairs' it doesn't seem to be much trouble to insert `()` after completion. Besides, not all languages use `()` after function name in calls.\r\n\r\nAnd 'mini.pairs' also doesn't seem to be a good place for that.\r\n\r\nThanks for suggestion nevertheless!",
